{"unit_id":"Pasumao__dsh-plugin-notify#card-zh","repo":"Pasumao/dsh-plugin-notify","commit":"a802f00f4f9cc59893ec1df2218faf91552d8386","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notify 是 DSH Web 的 Windows 通知插件，监听 agent 状态和会话事件，在任务完成、中止、报错、等待选择或会话关闭时弹出 Toast。通知可显示任务摘要及工作区、会话标签，并支持仅跟踪根会话和按类型冷却。插件还会向系统提示词加入 Windows 路径、PowerShell 与编码要点。适合运行长任务或同时管理多个会话的用户；需要 Windows PowerShell 5.1、系统 Toast 支持及 Node.js 22.5 以上，不需 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:17-24","lib/index.js:284-315","lib/index.js:369-479"]}
{"unit_id":"Pasumao__dsh-plugin-notify#card-en","repo":"Pasumao/dsh-plugin-notify","commit":"a802f00f4f9cc59893ec1df2218faf91552d8386","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-notify sends Windows Toasts when a DSH Web agent finishes, stops, errors, waits for a choice, or closes. Alerts can show task and session labels, filter root sessions, and use a cooldown. It adds Windows usage guidance to the system prompt. Requires PowerShell 5.1 and Node.js 22.5+.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:17-24","lib/index.js:284-315","lib/index.js:369-479"]}
