{"unit_id":"Pasumao__dsh-plugin-notify#feature-4","repo":"Pasumao/dsh-plugin-notify","commit":"a802f00f4f9cc59893ec1df2218faf91552d8386","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notify 的功能「Windows 环境提示」：启用时向 DSH 系统提示词加入 Windows 路径、PowerShell 命令、文本编码和换行注意事项，并随插件停用而清理。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:284-315"]}
{"unit_id":"Pasumao__dsh-plugin-notify#caveat-1","repo":"Pasumao/dsh-plugin-notify","commit":"a802f00f4f9cc59893ec1df2218faf91552d8386","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notify 使用 Windows PowerShell 5.1 调用系统 Toast API；运行环境需支持 Windows 通知，并可通过 WINDIR 环境变量定位 PowerShell。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:70-74","lib/index.js:126-148"]}
